From 558b11692a9d74045217c4c4e81d0e9d4745c209 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 20:59:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(dsv41): extend compressor sharding, wqa_wkv decode
 tiles, and group trimming across TP2..TP8

- Pad compressor.fused_wkv_wgate per-rank shards to a multiple of 64 columns per part (_compressor_part_cols and _PaddedSplitColumnParallelLinear) so TP3 and TP5..TP7 column-shard wkv and wgate with bit-exact post-all-gather slicing and SP weight gathering.
- Add DECODE_FP8_CONFIGS and WIDE_DECODE tile entries for TP5 (384, 5120), TP6 (320, 5120), TP7 (256, 5120), and TP8 (224, 5120) sharded fused_wqa_wkv projections, plus SPLIT_BF16 entries for TP3 compressor shards.
- Extend _trim_padded_groups, attention forward/prefill/decode, and TileLangWOProjection to support wholly padded trailing ranks (real_groups == 0 on TP5 rank 4, TP6 ranks 4-5, TP7 ranks 4-6), skipping redundant wq_b, sparse MLA, wo_a, and wo_b compute while preserving collective participation and bit-exact outputs.
Upstream base: a75357bba81e31e4f3085700f94b6a0b29aed44a
Rationale: Extend column-sharded compressor fused_wkv_wgate, fused_wqa_wkv decode tiles, and _trim_padded_groups across TP2..TP8 (including wholly padded real_groups == 0 trailing ranks on TP5..TP7).
Quality: Bit-exact (torch.equal) with replicated compressor and attention projections across TP1..TP8.
Tests: pytest tests/models/test_deepseek_v4_1_compressor.py tests/models/test_deepseek_v4_1_attention.py tests/kernels/quantization/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_linear.py across 2 fresh container boots.
Upstream status: Local DeepSeek-V4.1 cross-topology TP2..TP8 parity.
